| # | File | What to Create | Why |
|:--|:-----|:---------------|:----|
| 4 | **`app/api/videos/[id]/report/route.ts`** | POST handler: validate session, insert into `reports` table | New `reports` table needs an API endpoint |
| 5 | **`app/api/users/[id]/follow/route.ts`** | POST/DELETE handler: insert/delete from `follows` table | New `follows` table needs an API endpoint |
| 6 | **`app/api/videos/search/route.ts`** | GET handler: query `videos` with `tsvector` search + join `videoHashtags` / `hashtags` | New search functionality |
| 7 | **`app/api/hashtags/route.ts`** | GET handler: query `hashtags` table for trending/autocomplete | New `hashtags` table needs an API endpoint |
| 8 | **`components/report-dialog.tsx`** | Report video modal UI (reason selector + optional description) | UI for the report feature |
